msgctxt "356"
msgid ""
"Oof... Good fight, Kiryu-san. You, my man, are full of shit and vinegar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "368"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "380"
msgid ""
"I was serious that time, man. More serious than a trip to the crapper after "
"my momma's five-alarm curry. And I'm seriously surprised you beat me."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "392"
msgid ""
"You're gonna have to give me a sec. Goin' Hyper Yonashiro takes a lot out of"
" me. Gotta take some time to recharge it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "440"
msgid "Whew... So whaddya think? Strong as balls, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "452"
msgid "Yeah..."
msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "464"
msgid ""
"You're gonna have to give me a sec. Gotta recharge after goin' Hyper "
"Yonashiro on ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "512"
msgid ""
"Damn, Kiryu-san! Ya done did it! Now you're a master of the nunchaku. Your "
"training is done-chaku!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "524"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "536"
msgid "Come on, Kiryu-san. The pun wasn't that bad..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "548"
msgid ""
"No, it's not that. Listen, Yonashiro-san... Are you really a strong fighter?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "560"
msgid ""
"<Italic>What</Italic>!? You injure me, sir! How could you look upon my sick "
"fighting skills and not despair?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "572"
msgid ""
"No. That's why I'm asking. To tell you the truth, I didn't have much trouble"
" beating you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "584"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "596"
msgid "So which is it? Are you holding back? Or are you really that weak?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "608"
msgid "Hah... Hahaha! Heeheehee! Ya got me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "620"
msgid "......?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "632"
msgid ""
"Not a single one of the chumps Kamiyama referred to me ever figured that "
"out. Not one! But you... Ohoho, you! You did! I should'a known you would."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "644"
msgid "What do you mean?"
msgstr "Cosa intendi?"

msgctxt "656"
msgid ""
"Well, let's talk about Kamiyama. Total genius, right? Yeah, nah. Only about "
"weapons. He has no freakin' idea how to judge a person's character."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "668"
msgid ""
"Been workin' with him for eons, man! Not a single dude he's sent could beat "
"a one-legged guy in an ass-kickin' contest. Ass-kickin' is what I teach, "
"man!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "680"
msgid ""
"But I didn't want to offend my roly-poly pal, so I've just been lettin' them"
" beat me and givin' them a little gold star for doin' the thing."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "692"
msgid ""
"You, though. You could kick a billion asses without even breakin' a sweat! "
"So you know what? Let's do this! <Italic>Let's do this</Italic>! "
"<Italic>YEAH</Italic>!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "776"
msgid ""
"Okay! It's... <Italic>Hyper</Italic>. <Italic>Yonashiro</Italic>. "
"<Italic>Time</Italic>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "788"
msgid "......"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "800"
msgid "What? Oh, too amazing for ya?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "812"
msgid "All you did was take off your hat..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "824"
msgid "Hey hey, someone's observant!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "836"
msgid "And that means you're going to fight seriously?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "848"
msgid ""
"Right. Yes. Look. This cap? This cap is literally a cap. You feel me? A cap."
" On my abilities. When I'm wearing it, my power is capped. When it's off, "
"I'm fully uncapped."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "860"
msgid "Um... Are you okay?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "872"
msgid ""
"Never better! Why do you ask? No, no, we can play doctor after this is done."
" So let's do it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "884"
msgid ""
"Same rules as before, drop me and don't get dropped. Only, forget that guy "
"you just fought. This is hard mode Yonashiro."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "896"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "908"
msgid "Bring it on, Kiryu-san! I'll try not to kill ya!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "956"
msgid "How was that?"
msgstr "Com'era?"

msgctxt "968"
msgid "Yeah! Perfect!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "980"
msgid "So when do I get my nunchaku?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "992"
msgid ""
"Never! Okay, not never. But they're my babies! I only give them out to "
"people who I know can handle 'em!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1004"
msgid ""
"What!? I can't even hold them? How am I supposed to master nunchaku without "
"using them?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1016"
msgid ""
"That's the Yonashiro style, baby. You can't truly master a weapon until you "
"beat an armed opponent unarmed... using your arms! And legs, I guess."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1028"
msgid ""
"Do that, and you'll be forced to learn the weapon's weak points. I've been "
"traveling the world fighting weapon masters for years. This is how you "
"learn."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1040"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "1052"
msgid ""
"Of course, I've seen some shit in my travels, man. Some "
"<Italic>real</Italic> shit, you feel me? That does things to a man. Kamiyama"
" says I'm creepy. Psh, like he's one to talk."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1064"
msgid ""
"But enough talk! Have any last regrets? No? Then let's begin the lesson! "
"Beat me!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1088"
msgid ""
"Oof... Good fight, Kiryu-san. You, my man, are full of shit and vinegar."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1100"
msgid ""
