msgstr "Già..."

msgctxt "1436"
msgid ""
"You're gonna have to give me a sec. Gotta recharge after goin' Hyper "
"Yonashiro on ya."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1532"
msgid "Whoa, whoa, whoa! Hold on a sec, bub."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1544"
msgid ""
"What do you think you're doin'? You're exactly the same as you were last "
"time we trained."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1556"
msgid ""
"How do you expect me to teach you new shit when you haven't even gone out "
"and used the old shit?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1568"
msgid ""
"Didn't your momma ever tell you to play with your new toys before you buy "
"more? Come back when you got a bit more <Color:7>experience<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1652"
msgid ""
"Second verse, same as the first. Beat me, and you win. Which do you wanna "
"try?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1700"
msgid ""
"Second verse, same as the first. Beat me, and you win. Which do you wanna "
"try?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1748"
msgid ""
"Second verse, same as the first. Beat me, and you win. Which do you wanna "
"try?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1760"
msgid ""
"Nunchaku, huh? You sure? Maybe I hit ya so hard you forgot, but I whooped "
"your ass with 'em last time. Or do you think you can actually beat me this "
"time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1772"
msgid "I do."
msgstr "Sì."

msgctxt "1784"
msgid ""
"Hahaha! Well all right then! Ladies and gents, would ya look at the jewels "
"on this one! Well, let's do the thing!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1808"
msgid "Tonfa? You got it. I'll show ya my one-handed tonfa technique."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1820"
msgid "One-handed?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1832"
msgid ""
"Yeah! Most chumps think they need a tonfa in each hand, but what they don't "
"understand is that one is more than two."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1844"
msgid ""
"My special one-handed tonfa technique is a real stunner. Heh, get it? Well, "
"you'll get it if you get hit by it. Try not to get hit by it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1856"
msgid "All right."
msgstr "Va bene."

msgctxt "1868"
msgid "Now let's get it on!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1892"
msgid ""
"You wanna learn about Kali Sticks? <Italic>You</Italic>? Kiryu-san, do you "
"even know anything about Kali Sticks?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1904"
msgid "No, not really."
msgstr "No, non proprio."

msgctxt "1916"
msgid ""
"They're part of Kali, a martial art from the Philippines. When I was "
"learning, my master kicked my ass into... Well, let's just say I haven't "
"completely caught up with it yet."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1928"
msgid ""
"While he was wielding those sticks, I couldn't touch him. It was like, think"
" you got me? Haha, nope! Wham! Ouch."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1940"
msgid ""
"So I knew I had to learn how to do it. I knew it in my bones... Or maybe "
"that was just all the cracks. But I did learn how to do it! And now, you're "
"gonna learn it, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1952"
msgid "...All right."
msgstr "...Va bene."

msgctxt "1964"
msgid "Now let's get crackin'!"
msgstr ""

